.TH GITMO 1 "May 2026" "GitMo 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
gitmo \- automatic GitHub sync for local project folders
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B gitmo
[\fB--background\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B GitMo
is a Linux desktop app for keeping selected local folders synced to GitHub
repositories with automatic commits and pushes.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --background
Start GitMo and immediately run it in the background when repos are enabled.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/gitmo/config.json
User settings.
.TP
.I ~/.config/gitmo/gitmo.log
Activity log.
